) Toothless (Franchise), 8 March 2017. [Online]. Available at: http://howtotrainyourdragon.wiki...\n3. Can Hiccup Supply Enough Fish to Maintain a Dragon’s Diet? | Semantic Scholar\n   URL: https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/Can-Hiccup-Supply-Enough-Fish-to-Maintain-a-Diet-Doua/ed279d4fe147e52ee70e70184b4ea7b813e4f43c\n   Toothless is a Night Fury dragon who appears in the How to Train Your Dragon (HTTYD) franchise, and is said to be the rarest, fastest, and most intelligent of the dragon species. In the 2010 film, Toothless is struck down during a dragon raid and loses his left tail-fin, leaving him trapped in a sunken area. This paper investigates the feasibility of Hiccup, a teenage boy, being able to supply ...\n4. journals.le.ac.uk\n   URL: https://journals.le.ac.uk/index.php/jist/citationstylelanguage/download/bibtex?submissionId=733&publicationId=699\n   @article{Doua_2017, title={Can Hiccup Supply Enough Fish to Maintain a Dragon's Diet?}, volume={6}, url={https://journals.le.ac.uk/index.php/jist/article/view/733}, abstractNote={&lt;p&gt;Toothless is a Night Fury dragon who appears in the &lt;em&gt;How to Train Your Dragon&lt;/em&gt; (HTTYD) franchise, and is said to be the rarest, fastest ...\n5. harbor-datasets/datasets/gaia/5d0080cb-90d7-4712-bc33 ... - GitHub\n   URL: https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor-datasets/blob/main/datasets/gaia/5d0080cb-90d7-4712-bc33-848150e917d3/instruction.md\n   What was the volume in m^3 of the fish bag that was calculated in the University of Leicester paper \"Can Hiccup Supply Enough Fish to Maintain a Dragon's Diet?\"\n6. View of Can Hiccup Supply Enough Fish to Maintain a Dragon’s Diet?\n   URL: https://journals.le.ac.uk/index.php/jist/article/view/733/684\n   Return to Article Details Can Hiccup Supply Enough Fish to Maintain a Dragon’s Diet?\n7. journals.le.ac.uk\n   URL: https://journals.le.ac.uk/index.php/jist/citationstylelanguage/download/ris?submissionId=733&publicationId=699\n   TY - JOUR AU - Doua, Ama